Package: peridial
Title: Peritonitis Indicators for Peritoneal Dialysis Units
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ernest", "Caballero", , "ernestcabs@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A standardised R framework for ingesting, validating, and
    summarising clinical peritoneal dialysis (PD) unit data. Four nested
    S3 classes represent the PD unit, its patients, their catheters, and
    each catheter's peritonitis episodes, supporting reproducible
    calculation of ISPD-recommended peritonitis rate and peritonitis-free
    percentage indicators from longitudinal catheter and infection
    records.
